<title>GREECE: KARAMOUZIS IS THE NEW CHAIRMAN OF ETEVA BANK-SOURCE.</title>
<headline>KARAMOUZIS IS THE NEW CHAIRMAN OF ETEVA BANK-SOURCE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>State National Bank's deputy governor Nick Karamouzis has also been named chairman of ETEVA Bank succeeding National Bank governor Theodore Karatzas, a market source told Reuters.</p>
<p>Karamouzis will head efforts to better coordinate the investment activities of the National Bank of Greece group, the source said.</p>
<p>ETEVA is the investment arm of the National Bank of Greece group. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
